server.log

# Compiled output of the main game — regenerated by dm.exe from Code/*.dm + assets on
# every build, and .rsc in particular repacks the whole asset tree (icons/sound/etc)
# into one blob, so it was the single biggest thing bloating repo history (removed from
# all past commits 2026-09-11; see DWLR_full_history_backup_2026-09-11.bundle for the
# pre-cleanup history if ever needed).
DragonWarriorLegacyRemake_8.0+.dmb
DragonWarriorLegacyRemake_8.0+.rsc
DragonWarriorLegacyRemake_8.0+.dyn.rsc
DragonWarriorLegacyRemake_8.0+.int
*.lk

# Player save files — per-machine runtime state, not project content. Every playtest
# rewrites them, and a guest save is created automatically by any guest login (including
# a headless server boot), so tracking them meant routine testing showed up as repo
# changes. Saves are also disposable by design here: the character format is versioned
# and migrates on load (CharacterSaveData, Code/Save/SaveData.dm).
Player SaveFiles/

# .NET build output for the Tools/ utilities (DWLRCombatCalculator). These are
# regenerated by `dotnet build`/`dotnet restore` and bake in absolute machine paths —
# the checked-in copies still pointed at "C:\Users\jpsch\Desktop\DWLR Test\", a location
# this project no longer lives in, which is exactly why they don't belong in git.
Tools/**/bin/
Tools/**/obj/
